#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/hpe_bare_metal/storage_management.rst:14
msgid ""
"During Morpheus instance creation, the provisioning workflow will delete "
"existing logical volumes,create a boot volume, and then identify the correct"
" disk deviceusing the device’s unique identifier (UID)."
msgstr ""
"During Morpheus instance creation, el provisioning workflow será delete "
"existente logical volumes,create un boot volume, y entonces identify el "
"correct disk deviceusing el device’s unique identifier (UID)."

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/hpe_bare_metal/storage_management.rst:16
msgid ""
"The boot volume is determined by matching the device UID found in the "
"storage controller to the corresponding Linux device path."
msgstr ""
"The boot volume es determined by matching el device UID found in el storage "
"controller to el corresponding Linux device ruta."

