#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/hpe_bare_metal/storage_management.rst:48
msgid "Remote Storage"
msgstr "Remote Storage"

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/hpe_bare_metal/storage_management.rst:50
msgid ""
"Remote storage enables lifecycle management of volumes on supportedHPE "
"Alletra storage arrays(includingAlletra MPandAlletra 9000, where supported) "
"and allows compute instances to attach to or detach from those volumes. "
"These operations can be performed during instance provisioning or post-"
"provisioning through the reconfigure workflow. The currently supported "
"transport protocol isFibre Channel."
msgstr ""
"Remote storage enables lifecycle management of volumes on compatibleHPE "
"Alletra storage arrays(includingAlletra MPandAlletra 9000, donde compatible)"
" y allows compute instances to attach to o detach desde esos volumes. These "
"operaciones puede be performed durante instance provisioning o post-"
"provisioning a través de el reconfigure workflow. The actualmente compatible"
" transport protocolo isFibre Channel."

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/hpe_bare_metal/storage_management.rst:52
msgid ""
"To get started with using remote storage, first, the storage plugin for "
"Alletra needs to be loaded, and a storage server added. This allows the user"
" to specify the URL where the management interface of the storage array is "
"available, along with the user credentials to manage the storage array."
msgstr ""
"To get started con using remoto storage, primero, el storage plugin para "
"Alletra necesita ser loaded, y un storage server agregado. This permite al "
"usuario specify el URL donde el management interfaz of el storage array es "
"disponible, junto con el usuario credentials to manage el storage array."

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/hpe_bare_metal/storage_management.rst:54
msgid ""
"There is also a concept of a datastore, which is used to represent a "
"container for a set of volumes. A datastore is associated with a storage "
"server and also a resource pool. The resource pool is used to represent a "
"site or a location, which is useful when storage HA is being used with "
"datastores associated with different sites."
msgstr ""
"There es también un concept of un datastore, cual se utiliza para represent "
"un container para un set of volumes. A datastore es asociado con un storage "
"server y también un recurso pool. The recurso pool se utiliza para represent"
" un site o un location, cual es useful cuando storage HA es being used con "
"datastores asociado con diferente sites."

