"be shared or unshared volumes. Any volume attached to the compute instance "
"can be resized to increase the size of the volume. Any attached volume can "
"be detached. However, volumes cannot be deleted from the Reconfigure action."
" Volumes can be deleted only from the infrastructure management section."
msgstr ""
"New volumes se puede crear y attached to el compute instance. These puede be"
" shared o unshared volumes. Any volume attached to el compute instance puede"
" be resized to increase el tamaño of el volume. Any attached volume puede be"
" detached. Sin embargo, volumes no puede be eliminado desde el Reconfigure "
"acción. Volumes se puede eliminar solo desde el infrastructure management "
"sección."

