#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/hpe_bare_metal/storage_management.rst:225
msgid "#. Reconfigure. Volume Consumption ------------------"
msgstr "#. Reconfigure. Volume Consumption ------------------"

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/hpe_bare_metal/storage_management.rst:229
msgid ""
"Consumption of volume is typically done through compute instance "
"provisioning, where the user can specify volumes to attach to, whether "
"existing volumes or new volumes to be created. It can also be done using the"
" reconfigure action."
msgstr ""
"Consumption of volume es típicamente done a través de compute instance "
"provisioning, donde el usuario puede specify volumes to attach to, whether "
"existente volumes o nuevo volumes to be creado. It puede también be done "
"using el reconfigure acción."

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/hpe_bare_metal/storage_management.rst:231
msgid "Instance Provisioning"
msgstr "Instance Provisioning"

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/hpe_bare_metal/storage_management.rst:232
msgid ""
"During instance provisioning, the user can specify volumes to be attached to"
" the servers within the instance. There are various types of volumes user "
"can specify."
msgstr ""
"During instance provisioning, el usuario puede specify volumes to be "
"attached to el servidors dentro de la instancia. There son various types of "
"volumes user puede specify."

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/hpe_bare_metal/storage_management.rst:235
msgid "Sharing"
msgstr "Sharing"

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/hpe_bare_metal/storage_management.rst:235
msgid ""
"Volumes can be shared or unshared (attached to a specific server only). "
"Specifying a shared volume means a single volume is attached to all the "
"servers within that instance. Specifying an unshared volume means a volume "
"is created for each server within the instance and exported to the "
"corresponding server."
msgstr ""
"Volumes puede be shared o unshared (attached to un específico server solo). "
"Specifying un shared volume means un único volume es attached to todos el "
"servidors dentro de que instance. Specifying un unshared volume means un "
"volume es creado para cada server dentro de la instancia y exported to el "
"corresponding server."

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/hpe_bare_metal/storage_management.rst:238
msgid "Existing vs New"
msgstr "Existing vs New"

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/hpe_bare_metal/storage_management.rst:238
msgid ""
"The user can specify a new volume to be created or specify to attach to an "
"existing volume. Existing volume is applicable only to shared volumes."
msgstr ""
"El usuario puede specify un nuevo volume to be creado o specify to attach to"
" un existente volume. Existing volume es applicable solo to shared volumes."

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/hpe_bare_metal/storage_management.rst:241
msgid "Replicated vs Unreplicated"
msgstr "Replicated vs Unreplicated"

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/hpe_bare_metal/storage_management.rst:241
msgid ""
"When creating new volumes, the user can specify that the volume is "
"unreplicated or replicated. Depending on the storage array deployed and the "
"HA configuration, replicated volumes can be specified as CPP (classic peer "
"persistence) or APP (active peer persistence)."
msgstr ""
"When creating nuevo volumes, el usuario puede specify que el volume es "
"unreplicated o replicated. Dependiendo de el storage array deployed y el HA "
"configuración, replicated volumes puede be especificado as CPP (classic peer"
" persistence) o APP (activo peer persistence)."

